.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Per-episode audit ledgers and LLM caches are run outputs, not source
# (docs/A3-DESIGN.md §22). manifest.json / metrics.json / run_params.json
# and aggregate results (results/sensitivity.md, results/tuning_log.md)
# are NOT covered by this rule and remain committed per that section.
results/**/ledger.jsonl
results/**/llm_cache*.jsonl